Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的妖马 炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说只要骑上它的人可以取得天下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在它被解开了封印
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且它的背后有着奈落的分身婴儿跟神乐的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:28.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:35.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:48.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:55.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:01:01.35,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:06.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:14.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:18.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:27.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:32.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:35.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:39.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:46.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是心理作用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.99,0:02:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我安份点 马上就会结束的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第141话 被释放的妖马炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子好饿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才不是才吃过鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是又没有吃到饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不介意的话 就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带着什么吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我是没有带什么啦 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有饭吃了 吃饭 吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神官大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 神官大人被杀害了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:26.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是指最近频传的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门杀害那些道行高深的神官和僧人这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道到底是什么人干的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一直发展到现在 事情绝不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也因为这样 被封印在神社里的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每到晚上就出来作乱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以村子才这么荒凉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有气味 虽然只是杂碎妖怪的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:15.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家可别大意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我 我一招就把他们通通解决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要开动咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样的事情在这附近经常发生是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 到处都是这样的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛抢我的 还我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高僧和神官接二连三地遭到杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底会是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:13.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶手好像是一个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听这么说 那个女人想必是神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了这个时候还以人类为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情怎么样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正如果这件事跟奈落那个家伙扯上关系的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不能袖手旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:43.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是 这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:45.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 现在神乐在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个倒不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近最有名气的僧人或神官是哪一位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是问还在世的高僧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近还活着的高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来最有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是万愿寺的神泉和尚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉和尚？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指那位神泉和尚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听过他的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是一位很有名的僧人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说论起封印妖怪的功力 无人能及...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连身为驱魔师的我也听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是非常有名
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是封印了那个人称炼狱鬼的食人妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及他骑的妖马“炎蹄”这个传说是最为有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问您怎么了吗 神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么…可能是我多疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像感觉到炎蹄在嘶鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:03.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是封印在我们后山祠堂的妖马
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄正如其名是一匹有着火焰马蹄的马妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时也是传说中能够日行千里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脚力非凡的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据传说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相隔百年前有一匹神马被卷入大火之中死去的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的怨灵出现在这个世上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且随着火山爆发转生成为炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之 都还不清楚咯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过传说还不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于炎蹄还有另外一个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑上炎蹄的话 就能够取得天下？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道是什么人传开的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这种说法广为流传
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然这种说法只不过是一种迷信罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为了炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类跟妖怪之间的争斗却没有停止过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过了跟人类与妖怪无数次的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到最后生存下来的炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄给予他骑上它的权利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是得到了炎蹄的炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变得气势逼人狂暴无比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为炼狱鬼的四处作乱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而让村民们感到痛苦不堪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是拜托了神泉和尚为他们驱魔除妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我跟炼狱鬼的战斗 持续了三天三夜的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且为了要封印炎蹄 耗个三天三夜也是必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易打败了这两个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且分别封印在两个不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:40.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个祠堂也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说起来 已经是很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉和尚能够打败如此厉害妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一位非常了不起的高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是预感…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:11:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过既然是能够封印那种妖怪的和尚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐会盯上他也没什么好奇怪的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 既然如此我们快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没时间在这里磨蹭下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爱使唤别人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么地方不对劲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没有感觉到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座寺庙的附近有邪气正在逼近当中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快点去躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟之前的那些家伙比起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像稍微厉害了一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身吧 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自以为是的布下结界了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:05.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说杀害高僧的妖怪是个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:09.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你们杀害了那些僧人跟神官的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这个婴儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起那个女人恐怕还要厉害数倍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让我窥视到此世与彼世的交界处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快退下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 下一招你还避得开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两下子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这一招又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:12:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我好好地来窥视你的心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成…功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…毕竟也老了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子…恐怕不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还很新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上有香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出事的地点恐怕是寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们并不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神乐下的手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里还留有那家伙的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:42.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手的是一个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有说错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父很勇敢地跟那个妖怪战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜为了保护我们两个人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易把两个妖怪其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个婴儿成功地消灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙被…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父的法力将他劈成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个婴儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.71,0:15:18.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落在白灵山之中再次诞生出来的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在白灵山崩塌的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.05,0:15:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还特地带那个婴儿逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.35,0:15:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落来说 他应该是相当重要的存在对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 总觉得没这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最猛胜…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想带我去什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神无
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落派你来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成你是代替奈落来教训我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个由神乐来保护
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正迟早有一天会变成这个样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窥视此世与彼世的交界处？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在杀了师父之前 那个婴儿就是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:41.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么窥视心灵…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.07,0:16:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐和婴儿到处杀害神官和高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来觉得是为了把被封印住的妖怪们给解放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来似乎没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此世与彼世的交界处
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有什么东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成是那个妖怪的封印吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么封印
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在后山是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们师父好不容易用他的法力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印住的一匹叫做炎蹄的妖马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个叫炼狱鬼所骑的那匹妖马吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:25.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:28.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:56.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你们也没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是犬夜叉 那匹妖马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好跟它算个帐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度好快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往这里来了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.47,0:18:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 既然如此我就用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 那匹马冲来冲去的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别管我 一定要想办法阻止那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样根本就瞄不准
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快点阻止那匹妖马的行动的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它停止移动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:52.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来你就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候干嘛阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了 大家快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:52.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.03,0:20:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为死定了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.93,0:21:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是想要去找被封印的主人炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快点追吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下一半 是要我怎么处理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点气息都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像动了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活过来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:24.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:40.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.35,0:22:46.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:50.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:56.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:06.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:14.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.36,0:23:17.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:22.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:28.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是你解开妖马封印的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄选择了个看似不祥的孩子骑在自己的背上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.21,0:23:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是白童子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.55,0:23:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该知道我也是奈落的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要窥视彼世与此世的交界处
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.95,0:24:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一能看到的是白茫茫的雾世界
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.69,0:24:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要不要也找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂暴的炎蹄与战栗的白童子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:14.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那么重要的事告诉他们
